        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 32a178ff-7271-42bb-b266-4447614e229a).Image",
        "Description": "Miami&apos;s race day is in full swing: engines roaring, crowds screaming, and the staff... barely holding it together.\rThe pit engineer is stressed, the instructor is yelling, the marshals are panicking, and the cops are acting like they&apos;re guarding the president.\rManagement claims everything is &quot;under control&quot;.\rIt isn&apos;t!\rYour job: provide five hardworking individuals with a &quot;permanent early-retirement plan&quot;.\rNo paperwork. No overtime pay.\rToday, you show them the real cost of hard labor.",
